WEBVTT

01:37.770 --> 01:38.770
Freeze!

01:39.450 --> 01:40.450
Take them!

01:43.050 --> 01:45.810
You want to be the emperor?
Fat hope!

01:46.050 --> 01:47.050
Take them!

02:01.770 --> 02:02.770
Pull out!

02:15.050 --> 02:17.450
Let's go! Hurry up!

02:26.650 --> 02:28.050
Forget about them!

02:29.050 --> 02:32.050
-Where are they?!
-I don't know...

02:36.050 --> 02:39.770
Your Highness, I know
it's heart-wrenching

02:40.810 --> 02:44.050
I didn't expect Ouyang Xiaotian
to be such a scoundrel

02:44.810 --> 02:48.050
To think I'd been shielding him
and speaking up for him

02:48.050 --> 02:49.650
I was so stupid

02:49.650 --> 02:53.050
Your Highness, you must never
give in to self-reproach

02:54.850 --> 02:57.650
Everybody had cautioned me
about Ouyang Xiaotian

02:58.050 --> 03:00.050
But I would hear none of their advice

03:01.050 --> 03:03.770
I even had doubts about you
because...

03:05.770 --> 03:12.810
Because I was jealous of Ouyang Xiaotian
and vilified him before you

03:14.050 --> 03:17.050
-I'm sorry
-Please do not say that

03:18.650 --> 03:23.050
I'd think the same way
if I were you, right?

03:25.050 --> 03:30.050
I'd rather you berate me.
At least I'd feel better

03:30.050 --> 03:34.050
-Why should I berate you?
-Why are you so nice to me?

03:34.050 --> 03:38.050
Do you know
why the sun rises from the east?

03:39.810 --> 03:42.050
Why do you get snow in winter?

03:42.770 --> 03:45.050
Why do flowers bloom in spring?

03:50.770 --> 03:57.050
Your Highness, my feeling for you
is akin to these natural phenomena

03:57.770 --> 03:59.250
It comes natural

04:01.050 --> 04:03.050
It's unconditional

04:04.450 --> 04:09.050
If Ouyang Xiaotian was half
as nice as you towards me,

04:10.770 --> 04:12.050
I'd feel more than gratified

04:38.650 --> 04:44.050
Your Highness, if you are half
as nice as Ouyang Xiaotian towards me,

04:47.050 --> 04:48.850
I'd feel more than gratified

04:59.050 --> 05:00.650
Stupid!

05:01.050 --> 05:06.050
Please have mercy. Wei Delu forced me
to do it. Mercy, Your Lordship...

05:06.050 --> 05:07.650
Wei Delu...!

05:11.650 --> 05:14.770
Your Lordship, all the weapons
and personnel are ready

05:16.050 --> 05:20.050
After so many years of waiting,
it's time we struck!

05:20.050 --> 05:23.810
Your Lordship, we'll support you
to be the emperor. Go for it!

05:25.050 --> 05:28.050
It's the last chance I'm giving you!

05:29.650 --> 05:34.050
Place everybody on combat readiness.
We will storm the city!

05:47.650 --> 05:50.650
Your Highness, I'm forced to do it!

05:54.810 --> 05:56.050
Congratulations, Your Lordship

05:56.050 --> 05:59.450
This elixir of life
has finally been produced!

06:04.650 --> 06:08.050
Excellent! Excellent!

06:09.810 --> 06:13.770
It will give me a long life
to rule the evelasting kingdom!

06:25.450 --> 06:27.810
I am the true emperor...!

06:47.050 --> 06:50.810
Who are you?
Why did you do this to me?

06:56.050 --> 06:57.650
Who are you?

06:57.650 --> 07:01.770
-We are the smart and the witty...
-The pretty and the refined!

07:01.770 --> 07:05.050
-The kind-hearted...
-The people who never gossip

07:05.050 --> 07:07.810
-Shishi!
-Feifei!

07:08.050 --> 07:11.450
You don't know me at all.
Why did you do this to me?

07:11.450 --> 07:12.450
We didn't

07:12.450 --> 07:14.810
-We're so kind
-We won't do that to you

07:14.810 --> 07:16.050
He is the one!

07:18.050 --> 07:22.810
Ouyang Xiaotian, there isn't
any elixir of life in this world

07:23.050 --> 07:27.810
You've been extensively poisoned.
You'll die in 6 hours

07:27.810 --> 07:31.050
-Who the hell are you?
-Don't you know him?

07:31.050 --> 07:34.050
He is the invincible
king of the West Mountain

07:34.050 --> 07:36.050
He's known as God of Plague!

07:36.050 --> 07:39.810
-What do you want?
-I'm the only one who can help you

07:39.810 --> 07:40.810
But you must be subservient to me
and be my lackey!

07:44.650 --> 07:46.050
Out of the question!

07:46.650 --> 07:50.650
You'll be an emperor too
if you work with our chief

07:50.650 --> 07:52.450
Will you be so kind-hearted?

07:52.450 --> 07:55.770
Who doesn't want to be an emperor?
Don't tell me you don't?

07:56.450 --> 07:59.050
I think nothing of the emperor
in the mortal world

07:59.650 --> 08:02.050
I aspire to be the Jade Emperor
in Heaven!

08:03.770 --> 08:08.050
Both the Earth and Heaven
will worship nobody else but me!

08:21.050 --> 08:26.650
I asked Heaven for three wishes.
I had two of them come true

08:27.650 --> 08:29.650
I fear I could be the Longevity Star

08:31.050 --> 08:33.450
You mustn't have groundless fears

08:33.450 --> 08:39.650
The fact that that bird flew to you
could just be a coincidence

08:40.650 --> 08:46.050
I saved a boy's life
not long after I made my second wish

08:46.650 --> 08:49.810
The boy's father turned out
to be a rich man in the Capital

08:49.810 --> 08:53.050
He reciprocated by donating money
to renovate the Three Star Temple

08:53.050 --> 08:54.810
Was that an accident too?

08:54.810 --> 08:56.770
Yet you turned down his offer

08:57.050 --> 09:00.050
He decided to part with his money
only after seeing the draft plan

09:00.050 --> 09:03.650
There was nothing
which suggested anything unusual

09:03.650 --> 09:07.050
Why did you say
Heaven answered your prayers?

09:07.650 --> 09:14.650
I don't know why you'd believe it only
if it's shrouded in mystery and miracles

09:15.450 --> 09:22.050
But of course. And I'd only believe it
if there is no human intervention

09:30.050 --> 09:33.050
See this - "I am Longevity Star"?

09:41.050 --> 09:42.770
What are you doing?

09:43.450 --> 09:48.050
I'll treat this as my third wish
I've yet to make

09:48.770 --> 09:50.450
You've seen this slip

09:51.450 --> 09:54.050
I will bury it

09:54.770 --> 10:03.050
If I get to see this slip again one day,
it shows that I'm THE Longevity Star

10:03.050 --> 10:05.050
Fu, you're the Fortune Star

10:05.050 --> 10:07.050
And Lu, the Prosperity Star

10:07.810 --> 10:10.050
I have my reservations

10:11.050 --> 10:16.050
But we can try this method
which will remove the human factor

10:16.650 --> 10:20.050
It'll be practically impossible
for you to see this slip again

10:20.050 --> 10:24.810
Never mind about it returning to
your hands. That'll be a miracle

10:25.050 --> 10:28.050
Fine. Both of you
agree with this method

10:28.050 --> 10:29.770
That's my last wish

10:32.050 --> 10:37.050
Shou, tell me if you look forward
to seeing this slip again

10:37.810 --> 10:41.050
I don't know either.
Ruyi and I are getting married

10:41.650 --> 10:45.050
The slip, if I happen to see it again,
will prove that I'm Longevity Star

10:45.050 --> 10:48.650
I won't be able to marry Ruyi.
Won't I be letting her down?

10:48.650 --> 10:52.810
My dear, neither do I wish
to see this slip again

10:52.810 --> 10:55.050
I want to spend
my life with Shuangxi!

10:55.050 --> 11:00.050
Never mind about me. I believe
the princess will change her mind

11:00.770 --> 11:03.050
I wouldn't like to see this slip either

11:03.050 --> 11:06.770
Since nobody likes to see it,
I will have it buried

11:10.450 --> 11:11.770
Let's go

11:45.650 --> 11:51.810
Does that mean Ouyang Xiaotian
plans to attack the Palace?

11:52.050 --> 11:53.810
I will guard the Palace!

11:57.050 --> 11:58.450
Here come the fruit!

12:02.050 --> 12:04.050
Let's have honeydew melon!

12:05.650 --> 12:08.650
From where did you buy
such nice melons?

12:09.050 --> 12:11.050
I picked them from the road

12:12.050 --> 12:14.050
From the road?
That easy?

12:14.050 --> 12:19.650
Yeah, I tripped on my way here
and I saw these melons

12:21.050 --> 12:24.050
Let me do it.
I have a chopper!

12:27.650 --> 12:31.770
Oh yes, I remember.
We'll seek external assistance!

12:41.050 --> 12:42.050
There is a character!

12:43.050 --> 12:44.650
Let's go home...

12:47.650 --> 12:51.650
Sorry, I need to discuss something
more important with the Princess

12:52.650 --> 12:54.450
Uncle, there are characters!

12:54.450 --> 12:56.810
Ruyi, I will go out with Jiujin!

13:04.050 --> 13:07.050
I am the Longevity Star -
what does it mean?

13:34.050 --> 13:35.050
What's wrong?

13:36.050 --> 13:40.650
Don't you rejoice too soon.
Extreme elation will lead to tragedies

13:42.050 --> 13:44.650
If you have nothing good to say,

13:44.650 --> 13:47.650
you won't get to taste
the wedding wine I brew

13:50.050 --> 13:54.770
I will drink up the wine
if you can't make up your mind

13:57.810 --> 13:59.770
Go ahead and drink it up

14:00.650 --> 14:05.050
I can't possibly crave after the wine
at the expense of my friends

14:05.050 --> 14:09.050
You'll still have a chance
if you're prepared to turn around

14:09.810 --> 14:13.050
I'm prepared to give up everything
just to be with Shou

14:14.810 --> 14:18.050
Would you do the same
if you could no longer be an immortal?

14:18.810 --> 14:20.050
I envy couples but not immortals!

14:21.810 --> 14:25.050
Shou is yet to find out
if he is Longevity Star-incarnate

14:25.050 --> 14:29.050
I'm afraid he may not want to give up
everything if he knows the truth

14:29.650 --> 14:33.770
You needn't worry about that.
I have absolute faith in Shou

14:33.770 --> 14:36.050
What if he insists on
being an immortal?

14:40.050 --> 14:41.810
I will agree with his decision

14:43.810 --> 14:45.450
You can't be more stupid!

14:46.050 --> 14:49.050
To you it's stupidity;
to me it's a worthwhile cause

14:49.810 --> 14:52.650
I've made up my mind.
You need say nothing

14:53.810 --> 14:55.050
Please drink

14:59.810 --> 15:03.770
Why did you stop? You love
to drink my wine, don't you?

15:06.050 --> 15:10.050
Drinking the wine would imply that
your marriage with Longevity...

15:10.050 --> 15:11.650
has had my blessing

15:13.050 --> 15:15.810
I really can't do it
against my conscience

15:16.770 --> 15:18.050
Don't take it as my wedding wine

15:18.050 --> 15:21.050
A farewell drink to the fraternity
we forged when we were...

15:21.050 --> 15:22.810
in the Celestial Court

15:28.050 --> 15:29.450
Excellent wine!

15:32.050 --> 15:38.650
A pity I might not have the fortune
to taste your wine again

15:40.050 --> 15:42.050
Look me up in the mortal world
when you have the time

15:42.050 --> 15:43.770
I will make you the best wine

15:44.650 --> 15:47.050
I hope I'll have that chance

15:59.810 --> 16:05.050
I promise I will be a good wife to you.
I'll stop throwing tantrums at you

16:05.650 --> 16:08.650
Ruyi, stop being so nice to me

16:10.050 --> 16:11.450
Why?

16:12.050 --> 16:16.770
I'd been wondering
if I was Longevity Star-incarnate

16:18.850 --> 16:23.050
I asked Heaven for three wishes
when I was in the woods the other day

16:25.050 --> 16:28.650
All the three wishes
came true one after another

16:29.050 --> 16:31.650
It's proven
that I'm Longevity Star

16:32.650 --> 16:36.650
You can't run away if you're destined
to go back to the Celestial Court

16:37.810 --> 16:40.770
Let nature take its course.
Stop feeling so vexed

16:43.050 --> 16:44.650
If I have to go,

16:47.050 --> 16:48.770
what will become of you?

17:02.850 --> 17:05.770
I can't get myself
to leave you behind all alone

17:09.810 --> 17:11.770
Tell me what I should do

17:23.050 --> 17:27.810
I'd wanted to tell you this
only after our wedding

17:29.050 --> 17:34.050
Now that you're going to be an immortal,
I'd like you to do me a favour

17:34.810 --> 17:36.050
What kind of favour?

17:37.770 --> 17:40.770
I know how to remove
the Obedience Spell

17:41.050 --> 17:44.050
Serious?
Tell me what you want me to do

17:46.050 --> 17:51.650
What you need are these words:
a passionate kiss

17:52.810 --> 17:54.050
A passionate kiss?

17:56.050 --> 17:58.050
Are you saying you and I...

18:35.050 --> 18:38.810
-Did we do it right?
-I think so

18:41.050 --> 18:43.050
It's late.
I'm going home

18:46.650 --> 18:49.050
Don't go yet.
I have something to say to you

18:51.050 --> 18:55.770
How come? Didn't you say a passionate
kiss will remove the spell?

19:06.450 --> 19:11.050
Between me and immortality,
you've long made up your choice

19:12.050 --> 19:13.050
I haven't

19:15.050 --> 19:21.650
It isn't your fault. We may be fated
to meet but not to marry

19:24.050 --> 19:29.650
My only wish is that you'll do good
to the mortals once you're an immortal

19:30.050 --> 19:32.650
You'll be a deity
loved by ordinary people

19:52.050 --> 19:54.650
Master Wei, do you feel vexed too?

19:57.050 --> 20:03.050
I'm vexed because I can see that
Your Highness is feeling troubled

20:03.770 --> 20:08.810
But I can't think of ways to help
Your Highness solve your problem

20:09.050 --> 20:12.050
You do seem capable
of reading my mind

20:13.050 --> 20:15.050
My father is in deep trouble

20:15.810 --> 20:20.050
We must act quick to stop Ouyang
Xiaotian from betraying the kingdom

20:21.050 --> 20:23.050
Your Highness can't be more precise

20:23.050 --> 20:27.050
I've been thinking of ways
to deal with Ouyang Xiaotian

20:27.810 --> 20:30.770
But if we were to take on Ouyang's
army with our military strength,

20:30.770 --> 20:33.770
we'll have to use the means
of vertical and horizontal alliances

20:33.770 --> 20:35.650
Vertical and horizontal alliances?

20:35.650 --> 20:39.810
Joining hands with other people
to curb Ouyang's forces?

20:40.050 --> 20:42.050
Have you thought of the candidates?

20:43.050 --> 20:46.050
-The barbarians
-Impossible

20:46.770 --> 20:50.770
They've been coveting our state. We're
opening our doors open to our enemies!

20:52.770 --> 20:56.650
The barbarians may have been
trying to invade the Central Plains,

20:56.650 --> 21:01.050
but we've mended our relationship
with them

21:01.050 --> 21:05.050
Their current king may be
a man of ferocious temper,

21:05.770 --> 21:07.810
but he is upright and loyal

21:08.050 --> 21:12.650
I'm sure he'll not sit idle
when His Majesty is in trouble

21:13.050 --> 21:15.770
I ever met the king on one occasion

21:16.450 --> 21:19.810
Indeed he is a man who does not fuddle
and who cherishes friendship

21:20.050 --> 21:26.770
Him aside, we can also link up with
other dukes to contain Ouyang

21:28.810 --> 21:31.050
Fine, we'll adopt your method

21:32.650 --> 21:34.050
Here is an order for Wei Delu!

21:35.650 --> 21:37.450
Here is Wei Delu!

21:38.050 --> 21:42.650
I order you to work with the Palace
to canvas the states in the west

21:42.650 --> 21:45.050
We will crush Ouyang Xiaotian's plot
to betray the kingdom!

21:45.050 --> 21:46.650
Yes, Your Highness

21:47.050 --> 21:50.650
Rest assured, Your Highness, that
regardless of the dangers involved,

21:50.650 --> 21:55.050
I will do my utmost to assist
Your Highness in defending the Kingdom!

22:11.650 --> 22:14.650
I am Marquis Ouyang Xiaotian,
Your Majesty!

22:15.450 --> 22:19.770
-How is it going on?
-Your Majesty, it's almost ready

22:19.770 --> 22:22.810
An order from Your Majesty
and I'll launch the attack!

22:23.050 --> 22:26.650
-It has to be put on hold
-Why is that so?

22:28.050 --> 22:31.650
The dukes from the western region
have gathered a 300,000-strong army...

22:31.650 --> 22:34.050
and joined hands with the imperial army
to declare war on you!

22:34.050 --> 22:38.050
You'll be caught unawares if you
launch an attack at this juncture!

22:38.650 --> 22:39.810
Is that true?

22:39.810 --> 22:43.650
Nothing in the universe will escape
our master's sharp eyes!

22:43.650 --> 22:47.650
Our master will know what's on your mind
the moment you twitch your eyebrows

22:47.650 --> 22:51.050
Wise is Your Majesty.
I'm but fatuous

22:51.050 --> 22:55.770
I'd wanted you to launch an attack
and create a war situation

22:56.050 --> 23:00.050
The Celestial Court will be affected
the moment there is chaos

23:00.050 --> 23:03.050
Then I'd have the opportunity to strike

23:04.050 --> 23:10.050
Little did I expect the Trio
to ruin my plan at the 11th hour!

23:10.810 --> 23:14.050
The three stars?
Just who are those people?

23:14.050 --> 23:18.650
In fact, Wei Delu
is Prosperity Star-incarnate

23:18.650 --> 23:22.050
Wu Feqi and Mei Shouquan are Longevity
Star- and Fortune Star-incarnates

23:22.050 --> 23:24.650
There were three stars in heaven...

23:24.650 --> 23:28.650
who used to bestow the mortals
fortune, longevity or prosperity

23:28.650 --> 23:33.050
The Jade Emperor was annoyed and got
them punished among the mortals

23:33.650 --> 23:37.050
They're deprived of fortune,
longevity and prosperity

23:37.050 --> 23:40.050
That explains why I failed
to tame those three thugs

23:40.050 --> 23:41.810
They are immortals

23:42.050 --> 23:46.770
They used to be immortals but now,
they're no different from the mortals

23:47.050 --> 23:50.650
They're made of flesh and blood.
You needn't fear them

23:50.650 --> 23:53.050
It's only a matter of time
before they give us hell

23:53.050 --> 23:55.050
We must get rid of them
as soon as we can

23:55.050 --> 23:58.650
That's right. If we let them
be immortalized,

23:59.050 --> 24:05.050
your throne will be shaken even if
you manage to capture the Capital

24:05.050 --> 24:08.770
That's right. I will
get my men to annihilate them!

24:08.770 --> 24:14.650
They may be mortals but they've got
the fairy, Ma-gu's protection

24:14.650 --> 24:16.650
You may be thwarted!

24:17.050 --> 24:18.650
I'm baffled

24:19.810 --> 24:24.050
The Jade Emperor should know the liaison
between Ma-gu and Mei Shouquan

24:25.050 --> 24:28.050
They should've been summoned
to the Celestial Court and punished!

24:31.650 --> 24:34.770
Don't tell me
you didn't do a good job?!

24:35.650 --> 24:39.050
We'll own up. We were on our way
to the Celestial Court the other day

24:39.050 --> 24:43.050
But we met Zhang Guolao
and told him everything

24:43.050 --> 24:47.050
He was furious and he vowed
to tell the Jade Emperor himself

24:48.650 --> 24:50.050
You're stupid! Stupid!

24:51.050 --> 24:53.650
Zhang and the three stars
are as close as siblings

24:53.650 --> 24:57.650
He'll never betray them!
This is outrageous!

24:58.050 --> 25:00.650
Master, please pardon them

25:00.650 --> 25:05.050
We're now in the same boat.
We can't afford an internal strife

25:07.050 --> 25:09.650
Your rotten lives are spared
for the time being!

25:10.650 --> 25:11.770
Thank you, Master!

25:12.810 --> 25:16.650
It looks like
I have to do it myself!

25:16.650 --> 25:20.050
Your Majesty, I have a scheme
to subdue those three stars

25:20.050 --> 25:21.450
Out with it!

25:21.450 --> 25:25.050
With Ma-gu sticking with him,
Mei Shouquan isn't easy to deal with

25:25.050 --> 25:30.050
Wei Delu has a big army.
Wu Fuqi is the only easy target

25:30.650 --> 25:32.450
What do you intend to do?

25:32.450 --> 25:37.770
We'll turn them into enemies
by exploiting Fuqi's soft spot

25:37.770 --> 25:42.050
-You mean Yu Shuangxi?
-Wise is Your Majesty!

25:46.050 --> 25:47.050
Excellent!

26:07.650 --> 26:08.810
Be careful!

26:17.810 --> 26:20.650
You must remember the protocols
practised by the tribe

26:21.050 --> 26:25.770
Rest assured, Your Highness. This is
your second trip to the Western Region

26:26.650 --> 26:27.810
Careful!

26:30.050 --> 26:34.050
You're more experienced.
I will heed your advice

26:35.050 --> 26:38.050
I'll have no worries
if you're willing to learn

26:39.050 --> 26:44.810
I used to be so full of myself that
I thought I'd never do anything wrong

26:44.810 --> 26:49.050
I learned through hard knocks
as I'd offended many people

26:49.050 --> 26:50.810
Only now do I know...

26:58.810 --> 27:01.650
Looks like I need to relook
at my assessment about you

27:16.050 --> 27:19.650
-Your Majesty, the Princess is here!
-Invite her in

27:26.050 --> 27:28.050
My warmest welcome, Your Highness

27:28.050 --> 27:31.810
I thought I'd never get to see
Your Highness again after our last meet

27:31.810 --> 27:33.850
I felt very good
about my last visit here

27:33.850 --> 27:39.050
-I could never forget your milk wine
-Then you must have more this time round

27:39.810 --> 27:41.050
Let me introduce you

27:41.050 --> 27:45.650
-He is our Top Scholar, Wei Delu
-Your Majesty...

27:46.450 --> 27:49.650
Master Wei must've had
a tiring journey. Please come in

27:53.810 --> 27:57.810
It must've been a long journey.
Here is a toast from me!

28:03.450 --> 28:07.650
Your Highness, I was told
your father was taken seriously ill

28:07.650 --> 28:09.050
Is he better now?

28:09.650 --> 28:12.050
Thank you, Your Majesty.
My father has completely recovered

28:12.050 --> 28:16.050
He thought of you very often. He asked
me to convey his special regards

28:16.050 --> 28:17.770
It's very nice of your father

28:17.770 --> 28:22.650
Your Highness, why didn't Marquis
Yonghuan come with you this time round?

28:24.050 --> 28:25.650
It's a long story

28:25.810 --> 28:29.050
I knew you must have something urgent
for coming in such a hurry

28:29.050 --> 28:31.650
Your Highness, out with it

28:31.650 --> 28:34.650
Since Your Majesty is so direct,
I will tell you the reason

28:34.650 --> 28:38.770
Ouyang Xiaotian is training his army
to attack our capital any moment

28:39.050 --> 28:41.050
My father was worried
he might not have enough men

28:41.050 --> 28:44.050
He hoped he'd able to quell the rebels
with your support

28:44.050 --> 28:48.650
Little did I expect Ouyang
to be such an ambitious man

28:48.650 --> 28:50.450
The situation is rather critical

28:50.450 --> 28:53.050
I hope that on account of
our many years of relationship,

28:53.050 --> 28:56.650
Your Majesty will extend your assistance
in riding over the current crisis

28:56.650 --> 29:00.050
The rebellion is your domestic problem

29:00.050 --> 29:04.050
It may not seem appropriate
for me, an outsider, to intervene

29:04.050 --> 29:06.810
We could not but have to borrow
Your Majesty's troops

29:06.810 --> 29:10.050
I'm sure my father will reciprocate with
a hefty reward once this crisis is over

29:10.050 --> 29:14.770
Your Highness, you've got me wrong.
I'm not after your money

29:14.770 --> 29:18.050
There are bound to be victims
when two armies are in battle

29:18.050 --> 29:19.770
If I were to assist you with my army,

29:19.770 --> 29:25.050
I'd have to explain to my people
the rationale behind our sacrifices

29:25.770 --> 29:27.770
Can't you persuade your people
on account of the friendship...

29:27.770 --> 29:28.770
between our two states?

29:28.770 --> 29:33.050
Your Highness, your remark shows that
you don't quite understand us

29:33.650 --> 29:35.650
Heroes are what we look up to

29:35.650 --> 29:39.450
If you want to convince us,
you must show us how capable you are

29:41.810 --> 29:47.050
Your Majesty, Your Highness isn't
particularly known for her martial arts

29:47.810 --> 29:52.650
If that's the case, I can't find
any plausible reason to offer help

29:53.050 --> 29:55.650
Your Highness, I must apologize

29:55.650 --> 30:00.650
I will host a banquet in your honour.
I hope you'll accept my invitation

30:01.050 --> 30:02.650
Your Highness, I still hope...

30:02.650 --> 30:06.050
you'll render assistance on account of
your friendship with my father

30:06.050 --> 30:08.050
Your Highness, let close the subject

30:08.810 --> 30:12.650
Your Majesty, will you allow me
to say a few words?

30:13.050 --> 30:16.050
Has Your Majesty heard of
the name, Zhuge Kongming?

30:16.050 --> 30:17.810
What are you implying?

30:17.810 --> 30:23.770
Fact is any dispatch to a battlefield
may not always incur sacrifices

30:23.770 --> 30:28.050
Your Excellency sounds rather capable
in deploying troops and personnel

30:28.050 --> 30:30.650
I do have a smattering of knowledge

30:35.810 --> 30:36.810
Your Majesty!

30:38.050 --> 30:42.650
Master Wei,
Muerchi is our military expert

30:42.650 --> 30:45.650
If you're able to beat him
in military tactics,

30:45.650 --> 30:48.050
I will promise to lend you my army

30:57.770 --> 31:00.770
Your Excellency, this chessboard
is our battlefield

31:01.450 --> 31:07.050
Each chip represents 10,000 troops.
What do you think?

31:11.050 --> 31:15.050
The chessboard and the chips
constituting the battlefield?

31:17.050 --> 31:19.050
I will not back out

31:22.810 --> 31:25.650
General, after you!

31:28.810 --> 31:31.770
I'll cross the river to attack
your kingdom from the south...

31:31.770 --> 31:33.050
with 100,000 troops

31:37.810 --> 31:42.050
I will station 10,000 troops
at all the crossing points

31:42.050 --> 31:47.650
I will sink an equal amount of boats,
carriages and weapons into the river...

31:47.650 --> 31:50.050
so that your boats will be grounded

31:51.050 --> 31:55.770
Besides, your soldiers grew up on
the prairies alien to marine battles

31:55.770 --> 32:00.770
I suspect your men will be marooned
in the waters

32:01.050 --> 32:04.810
I will raise 300,000 troops
to attack you from the north!

32:05.770 --> 32:09.050
-Are you sure about that?
-Of course

32:10.050 --> 32:14.650
I will annihilate your forces
with a 20,000-strong army

32:14.650 --> 32:15.770
Impossible!

32:15.770 --> 32:21.050
You have to cross the Moon Valley
to attack us from the north

32:21.050 --> 32:24.050
I will station my troops
on the mountain peaks

32:24.050 --> 32:27.050
We're bound to defeat you
from the vintage-points

32:27.050 --> 32:33.050
And I can even bury your army
at the valley with fire!

32:35.770 --> 32:39.650
In that case, I will capture your
capital with 1 million of our troops!

32:42.810 --> 32:47.650
This is 10,000 troops.
I only need to use half of them!

32:49.050 --> 32:53.650
How can you possibly take on my
1-million troops with your 5,000 men?

32:53.650 --> 32:55.650
Stop having fantasies!

32:59.050 --> 33:04.050
General, by throwing in your lot, you
are exposing your weaknesses actually

33:04.050 --> 33:07.050
By engaging all your troops
to attack our kingdom,

33:07.770 --> 33:11.810
indeed we'll only be able
to defend it for 10 days at most

33:12.050 --> 33:16.770
But I can deploy another 5,000
via the waterways...

33:16.770 --> 33:22.050
and capture your "horse"
from the rear within 3 days

33:26.050 --> 33:28.650
Excellent! Excellent!

33:29.050 --> 33:31.050
It's generous of General Mu

33:31.050 --> 33:34.770
I will honour my word
since we're the losers

33:34.770 --> 33:38.650
I promise to lend you 300,000 men
to put down the uprising

33:38.650 --> 33:40.650
Thank you, Your Majesty!

34:02.650 --> 34:05.450
Why are you looking at me that way?

34:06.050 --> 34:11.050
If this happened in my home,
my mother would feel over the moon

34:11.650 --> 34:15.050
She has such a beautiful and capable
daughter-in-law to cook for her

34:16.050 --> 34:18.770
Say that again
and you'll have no chicken to eat

34:19.650 --> 34:23.770
I'm serious.
I've run out of patience...

34:25.810 --> 34:29.770
How am I supposed to marry you when
you haven't even talked to my sister?

34:32.050 --> 34:35.650
I said I couldn't wait to taste
your drunken chicken!

34:37.810 --> 34:40.650
You're only good at
making fun of me!

34:43.050 --> 34:48.050
I take it that you've agreed
to marry me. No backtracking, OK?

34:53.810 --> 34:54.810
Sister...

34:55.810 --> 34:57.050
Enjoying your "food", eh?

35:00.050 --> 35:02.770
I thought the wolf
had snatched away my chicken

35:03.050 --> 35:05.770
So you two are enjoying it on the sly!

35:08.810 --> 35:12.850
This household keeps consuming without
any income. I bet it'll end up broke!

35:16.810 --> 35:20.650
Sister, please do not get angry.
It'll make you age faster

35:23.050 --> 35:26.050
I have something to discuss with you

35:27.050 --> 35:31.650
I thought you wouldn't have given us
a chicken for nothing

35:31.650 --> 35:33.050
So there was a motive

35:34.650 --> 35:37.810
I'd like to ask you
to let Shuangxi marry me

35:39.810 --> 35:44.810
Sure. Tell me what other gems you've
brought with you other than the chicken

35:46.050 --> 35:47.810
-Nothing
-Nothing?

35:49.050 --> 35:53.050
Don't ever think of marrying my sister
with only a chicken!

35:53.050 --> 35:54.050
Fat hope!

35:56.810 --> 36:01.050
Sister, you should know better his
situation than to make it hard for him

36:01.050 --> 36:02.650
Indeed I do

36:03.050 --> 36:06.770
Don't you think of marrying
if you don't have the means!

36:07.050 --> 36:12.050
The minimum is 100 taels of silver
plus silk and brocades

36:12.770 --> 36:15.050
Our neighbour, the Wangs,
just married their daughter off

36:15.050 --> 36:21.050
Other than the above, they also got
2 buffaloes, 4 goats and 8 pigs!

36:21.050 --> 36:24.050
-Sister, you can't compare us with them
-Why not?

36:26.050 --> 36:30.050
Their daughter is a barrel
with a toady face

36:31.810 --> 36:34.650
Wu Fuqi, look at this sister of mine

36:35.650 --> 36:40.650
You can't find a better figure
and waistline than hers

36:41.650 --> 36:45.770
What will people think of you
if they know it's only a chicken?

36:46.050 --> 36:48.050
My sister's only worth a chicken!

36:49.050 --> 36:51.770
Sister, why did you make it
sound so awful?

36:51.770 --> 36:57.050
Yes, I may not have money
but I do have the will and ambition

36:57.050 --> 36:58.810
Rest assured I will make it up

36:59.650 --> 37:06.650
I've never heard of the bride price
coming after the wedding. Fat hope!

37:07.810 --> 37:11.050
Sis, why must you squeeze
the bride price out of Fuqi-ge?

37:11.050 --> 37:15.770
-Aren't you selling me?
-Am I not doing it for your own good?

37:15.770 --> 37:19.650
What if that bloke dumps you
after having married you?

37:19.650 --> 37:22.650
Who's going to pay for your keep
if I don't ask for more money?

37:25.770 --> 37:28.810
Your eldest brother is your father
and your eldest sister, mother

37:28.810 --> 37:31.810
Now I'm like your mother.
It's settled!

37:37.050 --> 37:39.650
2 buffaloes, 4 goats and 8 pigs?

37:40.770 --> 37:44.050
Blame me for being so useless.
Where am I to find so much money?

37:44.050 --> 37:48.050
Not to worry.
I'll find ways to talk her round

37:48.810 --> 37:50.810
How much longer do I have to wait?

37:50.810 --> 37:56.770
"Oh my, where is my chicken?!
Hua, that's my laying hen..."

37:57.050 --> 37:58.450
You stole it?

38:01.450 --> 38:04.450
"I'm not Yu Daxi
if I don't hack you to death!"

38:06.810 --> 38:09.650
Thank goodness we were faster.
Your sister was real fierce

38:09.650 --> 38:15.650
It's just a chicken. I'll pay her back
100 chickens when I'm rich

38:15.650 --> 38:18.810
No, I'll make her a chicken house
plus a pigsty!

38:18.810 --> 38:22.450
Leave my sister alone. I'm past
caring if you have money

38:22.770 --> 38:25.450
Why don't you go back
to being a bodyguard?

38:25.450 --> 38:28.810
I'll stick with you, anyway

38:30.450 --> 38:33.050
Rest assured I'll not remain poor
all my life

38:33.050 --> 38:36.810
I will work hard to make money
and let you have a good life

38:36.810 --> 38:38.450
I believe you will make it

38:41.650 --> 38:43.050
Oh gosh, my pouch!

38:46.050 --> 38:48.810
You wait for me.
I'll get it back

38:48.810 --> 38:50.050
Be careful!

39:01.770 --> 39:05.050
Yu Shuangxi will no longer
be Yu Shuangxi from now on!

39:13.050 --> 39:16.050
It's always me.
Let's do it once more...

39:17.050 --> 39:19.050
The rest is yours. Adieu...

39:32.050 --> 39:35.770
Wu Fuqi!
Come on down!

39:41.810 --> 39:43.050
You rascal!

39:44.050 --> 39:46.450
How come you're so heavy today?

39:46.450 --> 39:50.650
It's you who have no strength,
no money and no competence!

39:50.650 --> 39:53.050
I'll think twice
if I should marry you!

39:55.050 --> 39:56.810
I think I should be all right

39:57.650 --> 40:00.050
You took my chicken
and claimed I'm fat!

40:00.810 --> 40:05.050
My sister is right.
It's a shame being married to you!

40:05.810 --> 40:07.450
No, you aren't heavy

40:07.450 --> 40:12.770
I told you I'd work very hard
to earn a living. It's no big deal

40:13.050 --> 40:19.050
You make it sound so easy. I want you
to make big money, not just money!

40:19.050 --> 40:23.050
I want a life of wealth and fame.
Can you give me all that?

40:25.050 --> 40:28.050
Didn't you just say
you wanted me to be a bodyguard?

40:29.050 --> 40:34.650
You're such a pig head. You could've
kept the tontine money all to yourself

40:37.050 --> 40:38.770
Are you joking or what?

40:39.810 --> 40:43.770
A bodyguard like me can never get
to escort a large sum of money

40:43.770 --> 40:45.810
It's hard for me to get rich

40:45.810 --> 40:49.050
You dare to do nothing!
What can you do?

40:50.050 --> 40:53.770
Shuangxi, what's wrong with you?
You keep talking about making money

40:54.810 --> 40:58.050
I'm raising my trousseau.
Blame you for being so incapable!

40:58.810 --> 41:01.050
I'll take you to see a place...

41:03.650 --> 41:07.050
-Just where are you taking me to?
-This is the place

41:08.050 --> 41:09.610
See, that's the one

41:11.050 --> 41:13.050
-Yunlai Gambling House?
-Yes?

41:13.810 --> 41:15.050
Why did you bring me here?

41:15.050 --> 41:18.650
This is the most well-known
gambling house in the town

41:18.650 --> 41:23.050
Is this another test or what?
Do you still have doubts about me?

41:23.050 --> 41:26.770
I've kicked the habit.
I will never gamble again!

41:26.770 --> 41:28.810
How will you make money otherwise?

41:31.050 --> 41:33.650
Are you serious
about wanting me to go in?

41:34.050 --> 41:38.810
I'm serious, Fuqi-ge.
Are you serious about marrying me?

41:39.770 --> 41:41.650
Indeed I'm serious about marrying you

41:41.650 --> 41:45.650
-Will you listen to my advice?
-Absolutely

41:45.650 --> 41:51.450
-I want you to gamble now!
-But you were deadly against my gambling

41:52.050 --> 41:53.810
I was very stupid and silly

41:53.810 --> 41:57.810
I didn't know you could haul in
a fortune if you played big

41:58.050 --> 42:00.050
It's the first time I'm hearing this

42:00.050 --> 42:04.650
Just do what I've told you to.
You won't lose

42:05.050 --> 42:07.050
Are you sure you won't regret it?

42:07.050 --> 42:10.050
I will regret it
if you don't give it a shot

42:12.050 --> 42:13.450
You said it?

42:13.770 --> 42:18.650
Fine, I will break the ban
and win a fortune!

42:23.050 --> 42:25.650
I bet you're doomed!

42:33.050 --> 42:35.770
Another loss - rotten luck!

42:37.650 --> 42:39.650
-Try again...
-No money!

42:45.050 --> 42:46.450
Shuangxi!

42:49.650 --> 42:50.930
What are you doing?!

42:51.450 --> 42:52.770
Hands off!

42:53.050 --> 42:56.770
-What are you doing?
-Aren't you happy I have clients?

42:56.770 --> 43:02.050
-Let's go home
-Didn't you come here to gamble?

43:02.050 --> 43:04.770
I've lost all my money.
Let's go home

43:04.770 --> 43:09.650
Fret not.
I am money when I'm here!

43:20.050 --> 43:22.050
Come, place your bet!

43:22.650 --> 43:24.050
Do you have money or not?

43:25.450 --> 43:31.770
Mister, don't I look like money?
I'm as good as his money!

43:35.450 --> 43:40.050
Gentlemen, do you think
I look like a gold ingot?

43:41.450 --> 43:46.050
If any of you win his money,
I will go home with you!

43:48.050 --> 43:52.050
-Shuangxi!
-I'm doing it for our future!

43:52.050 --> 43:55.050
Blame yourself for being so useless.
Go away!

43:58.650 --> 44:01.770
Are you serious, miss?
No lying on a gambling table!

44:01.770 --> 44:03.050
Absolutely serious!

44:06.050 --> 44:09.650
-Let's go home!
-But I've kept the ingots from them

44:09.650 --> 44:13.050
-Return them...
-I have confidence in you

44:14.050 --> 44:15.650
Let me give you some luck

44:19.770 --> 44:22.650
-Let's play Small and Big
-Sure, let's play that

44:23.050 --> 44:24.450
I'll bet small!

44:33.450 --> 44:34.530
Subtitles: H Yap
